    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simil</h2><br>Relax with <strong>Simil</strong>, the puzzle game that blends color, strategy, and tranquility. Connect matching color squares on an ever-changing grid, using a dynamic selector to shape your path. Navigate empty spaces and challenge your mind with increasingly intriguing levels. With a calm pace and vibrant design, <strong>Simil</strong> is your breath of fresh air amidst the everyday routine. Discover serenity in each connection and immerse yourself in an oasis of relaxation and quiet entertainment.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Over 50 levels.<br></li><li>Easy and accessible gameplay mechanics.<br></li><li>Clean graphics and vibrant colors.<br></li><li>Relaxing yet challenging game, perfect for de-stressing.<br></li><li>Regular updates with new levels and challenges.</li></ul><br>Whether you're seeking a tranquil but challenging brain workout or just looking to pass the time in a productive manner, <strong>Simil</strong> is the perfect choice.",
